Source: pg-integrity-checksums
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/VictorNagibator/pg_integrity_checksums

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-integrity-checksums
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-integrity-checksums
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Physical and logical data checksums for PostgreSQL
 Compute physical and logical checksums for pages, cells, rows, tables,
 indexes and databases. This is the renamed continuation of the SQL extension
 pg_checksums, unrelated to the PostgreSQL and PGDG command-line utilities.
 Follow upstream MIGRATION.md when moving from the old extension name.
